dash  We too love the quiet, but we can't always do what we want.\par 7.\emdash  We must [take off] (}{\i\f211 vacate}{\f208 ) from work in the month of August.\par 8.\emdash  While the factory remains closed, all the workers and employees depart on holiday at the same time.\par 9.\emdash  In the country nevertheless we can lead a quiet life.\par 10.\emdash  We fish in the lakes.\par 11.\emdash  The fish [from] (}{\i\f211 of}{\f208 ) these lakes are [tasty] (}{\i\f211 agreeable}{\f208 ) to eat.\par 12.\emdash  The lakes of this region are teaming (}{\i\f211 full}{\f208 ) with fish.\par 13.\emdash  Let's dive in the lake.\par 14.\emdash  Let you dive in the lakes.\par 15.\emdash  They come out of the lake.\par 16.\emdash  The water of the lake is fresh (}{\i\f211 sweet}{\f208 ).\par 17.\emdash  This city is near (}{\i\f211 neighboring to}{\f208 ) the lake.}{\par }}